      "name": "AppCompat",
      "version": "1.5.0-beta01",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/appcompat#1.5.0-beta01",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>API Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Add an overridable flag to disable the default switch width adjustment. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I37cb751f335e5388d09afdd3aafa91a47bd4d4b9\">I37cb7</a>)</li>\n <li>Add <code>@FloatRange</code> annotation to thumb position getter API (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/If524cd6196636c1dae353c6b7261f5136a3aa180\">If524c</a>)</li>\n <li>Add missing nullability annotations to <code>AnimatedStateListDrawableCompat</code> (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/Ieb4ec34c6bb43fb18a74e495fb322c65123883f3\">Ieb4ec</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Finalize <code>AppCompat</code> APIs for 1.5.0-beta01 (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I2a43d45452aef36c958e780c0678b2f62738b1f1\">I2a43d</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/236866227\">b/236866227</a>)</li>\n <li>Changing <code>className</code> value for <code>ActionMenuItemView</code> to treat it as a <code>Button</code> (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I5ee1c4f0d26e49c647a823a6d9b7ed32007d8441\">I5ee1c</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/7ca43e00a517eaeeedc0a21f482b17f06e3d2181..8fda1c7005de1555e6ae9b7a1ae5657c3b91eba7/appcompat"
    },
